---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="RustLoop"
  description="AI/ML community connecting practitioners across Youngstown, Cleveland, and Pittsburgh. From the ashes of Steel City rust to the future of Artificial Intelligence."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-flame-900/20 to-dark-950" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-flame">
          Youngstown &middot; Cleveland &middot; Pittsburgh
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-flame sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          From the ashes of<br />Steel City rust <span class="text-gold">to the future of<br />Artificial Intelligence.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gold sm:text-xl">
          Youngstown, Cleveland, and Pittsburgh produced the steel that built this country. It provided a life and a future for generations of families&mdash;but that era had an expiration date. What didn't expire was the people. Some of the sharpest, most resilient minds in America live along the corridor connecting our three cities. Youngstown may stay divided over sports, but our roots run deeper than any rivalry.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gold sm:text-xl">
          RustLoop has a simple mission: bring together the best minds working on Artificial Intelligence&mdash;and open the doors so the public can listen in. Our country, and the world, is welcoming a transformation we haven't seen since the advent of electricity. This region helped power the last industrial revolution. We intend to help power the next one.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="ember-glow inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-flame px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-dark-950 transition-colors hover:bg-flame-300"
          >
            Join the Community
          </a>
          <a
            href="/events"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-dark-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gold transition-colors hover:border-flame hover:text-flame"
          >
            Upcoming Events
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is RustLoop -->
  <section class="border-t border-dark-700 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-flame sm:text-4xl">
        What is RustLoop?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gold">
        [TODO: copy — to be written. Brief description of RustLoop as a community organization.
        What it does, who it serves, why it exists.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three Cities -->
  <section class="border-t border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/30 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-flame sm:text-4xl">
        Three Cities, One Community
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg text-gold">
        [TODO: copy — to be written. Why these three cities, what connects them.]
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {[
          { city: 'Youngstown', state: 'OH', tagline: '[TODO: city tagline]' },
          { city: 'Cleveland', state: 'OH', tagline: '[TODO: city tagline]' },
          { city: 'Pittsburgh', state: 'PA', tagline: '[TODO: city tagline]' },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="ember-glow rounded-xl border border-dark-600 bg-dark-900/50 p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-flame">{item.city}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-flame-300">{item.state}</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gold-600">{item.tagline}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Next Meetup Callout -->
  <section class="border-t border-dark-700 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-flame-700/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-flame-900/20 to-dark-900/50 p-8 sm:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-flame">Next Meetup</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-flame sm:text-3xl">
              [TODO: Next meetup title]
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-gold">
              [TODO: Date, time, location placeholder]
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/events"
            class="ember-glow inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-flame px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-dark-950 transition-colors hover:bg-flame-300"
          >
            See All Events
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Email Signup Placeholder -->
  <section class="border-t border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/30 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-flame sm:text-4xl">
        Stay in the Loop
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-gold">
        [TODO: copy — to be written. Email signup CTA copy.]
      </p>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          disabled
          class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-dark-500 bg-dark-800 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gold placeholder-gold-800 focus:border-flame focus:outline-none"
          aria-label="Email address"
        />
        <button
          disabled
          class="rounded-lg bg-dark-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-gold-700 cursor-not-allowed"
        >
          Coming Soon
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
